<SimplePage lang="en" title="Accessibility" noindex={false}>
<p>We want everyone to enjoy our nights. If you need step-free access, a companion ticket, seating near an exit or anything else, email <a href="mailto:info@orangetree.events">info@orangetree.events</a> before the event and we'll arrange it with the venue.</p><p>This website is built to WCAG 2.2 AA. If something doesn't work for you, please tell us.</p>
</SimplePage>
